<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<app version="1">
	<name>@NAME@</name>
	<version>@VERSION@</version>
	<release_date>@DATE@</release_date>
	<short_description>@MAC@ emulator</short_description>
	<long_description>Mini vMac emulating a @MAC@, filling the whole TV screen.

Put @ROM@ in sd:/apps/@FOLDER@/ along with your disk images (disk1.dsk, disk2.dsk, ... are inserted at start; HOME opens a menu to insert others).

Wii Remote: point and press A or B to use the mouse, D-Pad for arrow keys, 1 = command, 2 = option, + = on-screen keyboard, - = display mode, HOME = menu. Nunchuk, Classic Controller, GameCube pads and USB keyboards and mice work too.</long_description>
	<ahb_access/>
</app>
